    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think i want a \"smaller purpose.\" that just sounds like a way to linger. if a part of a machine is broken or just doesn't fit the new design anymore, you don't try to find a \"small purpose\" for it, you just replace it or discard it so the whole system can run smoothly. right? it's more logical to just admit when something is finished.",
